#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6052
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"To: %s\n"
"From: %s\n"
"\n"
"After treating Ensign Fargalli, we took a closer look at the accompanying "
"research. Analysis of the research material, the telemetry from your ship, "
"and recent reports from intelligence brings us to an ominous conclusion."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6058
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "What have you concluded?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6062
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"Fargalli's illness and the previous similar cases experienced were not "
"accidental. They were deliberately infected."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6066
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "What? Who infected them?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6071
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"The Exuari. Fargalli and others are apparently the victims of a preliminary "
"experimental biological attack. The Exuari have code named this biological "
"agent Omicron after the early 21st century pandemic virus variant on Earth "
"which was highly contagious."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6077
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "That's sobering. Do we have more information?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6083
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"Indeed we do. It looks like Omicron might be transmitted via subspace. We "
"believe the Exuari plan to 'broadcast' Omicron to every known human "
"location. Needless to say, this would have extinction level consequences."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6089
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "Ouch. Is there a planned response?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6095
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"Destruction of the Exuari Omicron production and broadcast facility is the "
"best thing we can think of."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6099
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "Can we help?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6104
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"We hope that you can. We don't know the precise location of the Exuari "
"facility, just a general direction. However, when we examined the telemetry "
"from your science officer's console when you were near the independent "
"medical research facility, we noticed something interesting."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6110
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "What did you notice?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6116
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"The entity used to produce the treatment is also likely to be used to create "
"Omicron. It gives off a powerful bio-signature that is periodic in nature, "
"vaguely resembling a heartbeat."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6122
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "This signature can identify the Exuari Omicron facility?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6129
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"Yes, but if you're unsure, you are authorized to destroy every Exuari "
"facility. You will need to travel into Exuari infested space along bearing "
"%i from station %s to find the Omicron facility and destroy it. Our best "
"intelligence estimates that deployment will occur within the next %i "
"minutes. Happy hunting!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6157
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"To %s\n"
"From: %s\n"
"\n"
"Ensign Fargalli, one of the maintenance engineers aboard the freighter %s, "
"just reported to sickbay here on %s. We can treat his symptoms, but don't "
"have a treatment for the root cause of his illness. This is the third case "
"of this type we've seen in the last week. The last two ended up being fatal."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6166
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "Why are you telling me this?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6172
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"We've received word that Independent station %s is conducting ongoing "
"research into this malady and may have more information, maybe even a remedy."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6181
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "Then you should get that treatment from %s to save Fargalli"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6190
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"We can't contact %s directly since they are not on our communications "
"network."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6196
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "A courier could get it"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6202
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"We tried sending couriers. All of our couriers were shot down. We are "
"telling you all this because we need you to go to %s and bring back any "
"medical research or treatment or medicine they may have"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6208
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "Now I understand"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6214
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"There is some urgency. Based on the previous cases, Fargalli has about %i "
"minutes to live"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6223
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "Where is station %s?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6233
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "%s is in sector %s. Good luck"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6244
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"%s is on an approximate bearing of %i from %s. Distance is greater than %.1f "
"units."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6269
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"%s is on a precise bearing of %.1f from %s. Distance is greater than %.1f "
"units."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6293
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"To: %s\n"
"From: %s\n"
"\n"
"Hello, %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6301
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Hello, %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6308
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"One of the commercial freighters just docked up and their personnel inferred "
"that you might be traveling in our direction."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6312
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Those are well informed personnel"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6317
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"It's amazing what commercial freighters learn and how quickly they learn it."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6323
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Indeed. Why are you contacting us?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6329
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We were wondering how soon you might get here. You see, there's this group "
"of Exuari approaching and they don't look terribly friendly."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6335
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We intend to get medical research, not necessarily engage Exuari"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6341
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We could make it worth your while if you were to protect our station from "
"these Exuari."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6345
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "How so?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6350
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"If you were to destroy the attacking Exuari, we could offer you one of these:"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6356
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "25% faster impulse speed"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6365
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6387
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6411
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6436
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "You got it. We're in sector %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6376
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Rapid transit back to %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6402
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "25% stronger beam weapons"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6427
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Replenish all your ordnance"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6449
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We just need to know where you are located"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6463
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We added paypoint %i to your system which identifies our station. We may or "
"may not be able to provide what you request depending on how busy we are "
"fighting off Exuari."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6473
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We are in sector %s. We may or may not be able to provide what you request "
"depending on how busy we are fighting off Exuari."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6486
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Sounds bad. Do you need help?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6492
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We welcome any help you might provide. It would facilitate our survival."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6498
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Could you provide us with your location?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6505
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "You mean %s did not tell you where to find us?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6514
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "They did, but we prefer greater precision"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6527
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We added waypoint %i to your system for our station. Your timely arrival "
"would be greatly appreciated."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6539
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "%s provided a bearing, but we prefer greater precision"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6548
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We are in sector %s. Your timely arrival would be greatly appreciated."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6565
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Your information is correct"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6570
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "That's great news. We've got some pesky Exuari in the area."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6576
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Let me guess, you want our help with the Exuari?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6583
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Got it in one. We're in sector %s. Please don't dawdle"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6591
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "They're everywhere"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6596
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"This batch is in our back yard. If you're going to be in the neighborhood "
"already, could you help us out?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6600
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Sure"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6606
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Great. We're in sector %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6618
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We're really only coming to get medical research"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6622
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Understood."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6631
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Identify your sector and we'll help"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6638
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Fair enough. We're in sector %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6649
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We might be. Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6654
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"Well, we've observed some Exuari headed our way. We don't think they're "
"making a courtesy call"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6660
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "They never do. Would you like our help?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6667
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Yes, please. We're in sector %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6676
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Where exactly is 'your way?'"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6682
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Our station is located in sector %s. We hope to see you soon."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6692
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We'd like to help, but we're having a hard time finding you"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6699
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We're in sector %s. Please hurry, the Exuari look dangerous."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6710
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Technically, our mission does not cover protection from Exuari"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6713
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Drat"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6720
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Where are you located?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6725
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We are in sector %s. Please hurry, the Exuari are approaching."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6732
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We are glad you contacted us"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6737
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Coincidentally, we are glad to be in contact with you, too."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6740
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Why is that?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6745
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We are in need of some assistance with Exuari that are approaching our "
"station, %s."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6750
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We can help"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6754
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "That's so good to hear. You may want to hurry, though."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6758
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Why the rush?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6765
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"The Exuari! They're getting closer! Please come to us in sector %s as soon "
"as you can."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6778
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"The Exuari! They're getting closer! I'm adding waypoint %i into your system "
"for our station. Please get here as soon as you can."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6791
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6812
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6834
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6855
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "In what sector is %s located?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6800
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6821
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6843
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6864
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "%s is located in sector %s."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6922
msgctxt "msgGM"
msgid "Empty Template pool: fix excludes or other criteria"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7045
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Farco models are evolutionary changes to the Phobos T3. In the case of "
"the Farco 3, the beams are longer and faster and the shields are slightly "
"stronger."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7082
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Farco models are evolutionary changes to the Phobos T3. In the case of "
"the Farco 5, the tubes load faster and the shields are slightly stronger."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7121
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Farco models are evolutionary changes to the Phobos T3. In the case of "
"the Farco 8, the beams are longer and faster, the tubes load faster and the "
"shields are stronger."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7160
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Farco models are evolutionary changes to the Phobos T3. In the case of "
"the Farco 11, the maneuver speed is faster, the beams are longer and faster, "
"there's an added longer sniping beam and the shields are stronger."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7205
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Farco models are evolutionary changes to the Phobos T3. In the case of "
"the Farco 13, the maneuver speed is faster, the beams are longer and faster, "
"there's an added longer sniping beam, the tubes load faster, there are more "
"missiles and the shields are stronger."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7252
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Whirlwind, another heavy artillery cruiser, takes the Storm and adds "
"tubes and missiles. It's as if the Storm swallowed a Pirahna and grew gills. "
"Expect to see missiles, lots of missiles"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7296
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Phobos R2 model is very similar to the Phobos T3. It's got a faster turn "
"speed, but only one missile tube"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7333
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The MV52 Hornet is very similar to the MT52 and MU52 models. The beam does "
"more damage than both of the other Hornet models, it's max impulse speed is "
"faster than both of the other Hornet models, it turns faster than the MT52, "
"but slower than the MU52"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7364
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"Enterprising designers published this design specification based on salvaged "
"Ktlitan Fighters. Comparatively, it's got beams that cycle faster, but the "
"hull is a bit weaker."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7395
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"Enterprising designers published this design specification based on salvaged "
"Ktlitan Fighters. Comparatively, it's got beams that are stronger and that "
"cycle faster, but the hull is weaker."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7430
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"Conversions R Us purchased a number of Adder MK 5 ships at auction and added "
"warp drives to them to produce the Waddle 5"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7467
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"Conversions R Us purchased a number of Adder MK 5 ships at auction and added "
"jump drives to them to produce the Jade 5"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7502
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The light drone was pieced together from scavenged parts of various damaged "
"Ktlitan drones. Compared to the Ktlitan drone, the lite drone has a weaker "
"hull, and a weaker beam, but a faster turn and impulse speed"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7534
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The heavy drone has a stronger hull and a stronger beam than the normal "
"Ktlitan Drone, but it also moves slower"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7572
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Jacket Drone is a Ktlitan Drone with a shield. It's also slightly slower "
"and has a slightly weaker beam due to the energy requirements of the added "
"shield"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7609
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The WZ-Lindworm is essentially the stock WX-Lindworm with more HVLIs, more "
"homing missiles and added nukes. They had to remove some of the armor to get "
"the additional missiles to fit, so the hull is weaker. Also, the WZ turns a "
"little more slowly than the WX. This little bomber packs quite a whallop."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7662
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"Loosely based on the Piranha F12 model, the Tempest adds four more broadside "
"tubes (two on each side), more HVLIs, more Homing missiles and 8 Nukes. The "
"Tempest can strike fear into the hearts of your enemies. Get yourself one "
"today!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7727
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Enforcer is a highly modified Blockade Runner. A warp drive was added "
"and impulse engines boosted along with turning speed. Three missile tubes "
"were added to shoot homing missiles, large ones straight ahead. Stronger "
"shields and hull. Removed rear facing beams and strengthened front beams."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7796
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Predator is a significantly improved Piranha F8. Stronger shields and "
"hull, faster impulse and turning speeds, a jump drive, beam weapons, eight "
"missile tubes pointing in six directions and a large number of homing "
"missiles to shoot."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7849
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Atlantis Y42 improves on the Atlantis X23 with stronger shields, faster "
"impulse and turn speeds, an extra beam in back and a larger missile stock"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7897
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Starhammer V recognizes common modifications made in the field to the "
"Starhammer II: stronger shields, faster impulse and turning speeds, "
"additional rear beam and more missiles to shoot. These changes make the "
"Starhammer V a force to be reckoned with."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7950
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Tyr is the shipyard's answer to admiral Konstatz' casual statement that "
"the Battlestation model was too slow to be effective. The shipyards improved "
"on the Battlestation by fitting the Tyr with more than twice the impulse "
"speed and more than six times the turn speed. They threw in stronger shields "
"and hull and wider beam coverage just to show that they could"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:7981
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Gnat is a nimbler version of the Ktlitan Drone. It's got half the hull, "
"but it moves and turns faster"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:8021
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Cucaracha is a quick ship built around the Tug model with heavy shields "
"and a heavy beam designed to be difficult to squash"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:8061
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The designers of the Starhammer III took the Starhammer II and added a rear "
"facing beam, enlarged one of the missile tubes and added more missiles to "
"fire"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:8109
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The K2 Breaker designers took the Ktlitan Breaker and beefed up the hull, "
"added two bracketing tubes, enlarged the center tube and added more missiles "
"to shoot. Should be good for a couple of enemy ships"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:8164
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Hurricane is designed to jump in and shower the target with missiles. It "
"is based on the Piranha F8, but with a jump drive, five more tubes in "
"various directions and sizes and lots more missiles to shoot"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:8210
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Phobos T4 makes some simple improvements on the Phobos T3: faster "
"maneuver, stronger front shields, though weaker rear shields and longer and "
"faster beam weapons"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:8292
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"Small, medium and large scale transport ships. These are the working ships "
"that keep commerce going in any sector. They may carry personnel, goods, "
"cargo, equipment, garbage, fuel, research material, etc."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:8363
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Service Jonque is a modified Equipment Jump Freighter 4. It's designed "
"to carry spare parts and equipment as well as the necessary repair personnel "
"to where it's needed to repair stations and ships"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:8656
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission1st-incCall"
msgid ""
"To: %s\n"
"From: %s\n"
"\n"
"Greetings %s,\n"
"\n"
"Please ensure the safe arrival of freighter %s at %s. Looks like the Exuari "
"might attack them."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:8673
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:8792
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "The freighter blew up"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:8677
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:8787
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "Regional headquarters blew up"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:8697
#, lua-format
msgctxt "incCall"
msgid ""
"To: %s\n"
"From: %s\n"
"\n"
"%s,\n"
"\n"
"Our engines just conked out and the only person we have that can fix them is "
"too sick to work on them. Can you send over one of you repair crew to help "
"us, please?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:8711
msgctxt "crewTransfer-buttonEngineer"
msgid "Send Repair Crew"
msgstr ""

